1
00:00:00,927 --> 00:00:02,557
(Sheldon:)And yet you get to weigh in.

2
00:00:02,562 --> 00:00:04,232
(Sheldon:)Democracy... it's pretty cool,
isn't it?

3
00:00:04,230 --> 00:00:07,270
I'm not going;
you can't make me.

4
00:00:07,267 --> 00:00:08,937
(Sheldon:)Well, we'll just see about that.

5
00:00:08,935 --> 00:00:10,435
(Penny:)What is the problem?

6
00:00:10,437 --> 00:00:11,507
(Sheldon:)He says he's not coming

7
00:00:11,504 --> 00:00:12,634
(Sheldon:)to the Roommate Agreement
meeting tomorrow.

8
00:00:12,639 --> 00:00:15,439
(Penny:)Well, why the hell did
I memorize the Pledge?

9
00:00:17,444 --> 00:00:19,274
(Leonard:)You have fun.
I will not be attending.

10
00:00:19,279 --> 00:00:20,679
(Sheldon:)Oh, fine.
We don't have to have

11
00:00:20,680 --> 00:00:22,280
(Sheldon:)a Roommate Agreement meeting
if you don't want to.

12
00:00:22,282 --> 00:00:24,252
- Thank you. - Of course,
it will require a vote.

13
00:00:24,250 --> 00:00:27,290
(Sheldon:)Unfortunately, my official gavel
is in my bedroom,

14
00:00:27,287 --> 00:00:29,487
(Sheldon:)but luckily,
I have my travel gavel.

15
00:00:32,359 --> 00:00:34,489
(Leonard:)You're being ridiculous.

16
00:00:34,494 --> 00:00:36,094
(Sheldon:)There's a motion on the floor,
"I'm ridiculous."

17
00:00:36,096 --> 00:00:37,196
(Sheldon:)Do we have a second?

18
00:00:37,197 --> 00:00:38,727
(Sheldon:)Hmm? Hmm?
There is no second.

19
00:00:38,732 --> 00:00:39,902
(Sheldon:)The motion is denied.

20
00:00:39,899 --> 00:00:41,929
(Sheldon:)Next time, make sure
you have the votes first.

21
00:00:41,935 --> 00:00:42,935
(Sheldon:)That was embarrassing.

22
00:00:42,936 --> 00:00:45,806
(Leonard:)Can you please
talk to him?

23
00:00:45,805 --> 00:00:47,505
(Penny:)Well, why are you
fighting him on this?

24
00:00:47,507 --> 00:00:50,137
(Leonard:)Because I am tired of him
always getting his way.

25
00:00:50,143 --> 00:00:51,313
(Leonard:)We don't need a stupid meeting.

26
00:00:51,311 --> 00:00:52,581
(Leonard:)We don't even need
a Roommate Agreement,

27
00:00:52,579 --> 00:00:55,009
(Leonard:)and I hope that sandwich
does cause a party!

28
00:00:56,783 --> 00:00:59,083
(Penny:)Well, I will still
come to your meeting.

